# 🎨 Creative Portfolio Platform (React SPA)

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Creative Portfolio Platform** is a modern **Single Page Application (SPA)** built using **React with JSX components**. It allows users to showcase creative projects, dynamically add new ones, and filter them using a real-time search feature.

The application is designed with a **component-based architecture**, making it scalable, reusable, and easy to maintain.

---

## 🚀 Features

### 🏠 Landing Page

* Displays all projects in a clean, responsive grid layout
* Each project includes:

  * Title
  * Description
  * Image
  * Category

---

### ➕ Add Project

* Users can add new projects through a form
* Projects update instantly without refreshing the page

---

### 🔍 Search Functionality

* Real-time filtering of projects
* Users can quickly find specific projects

---

### 📱 Responsive Design

* Fully responsive across:

  * Mobile devices
  * Tablets
  * Desktop screens

---

## 🧩 Technologies Used

* React (Functional Components & Hooks)
* JavaScript (ES6+)
* HTML5
* CSS3 (Flexbox & Grid)
* Node.js & npm

---

