 ├── AddProjectForm
 └── ProjectList
       └── ProjectCard
```

---

## 🧠 State Management

The application uses React’s `useState` hook to manage:

* **projects** → stores all project data
* **searchTerm** → stores user input for filtering

---

## 🔄 Props and Data Flow

* `App.jsx` manages the main state
* Data is passed down to child components via props:

| Component      | Props Received            | Purpose                         |
| -------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| SearchBar      | searchTerm, setSearchTerm | Updates search input            |
| AddProjectForm | addProject                | Sends new project to App        |
| ProjectList    | projects                  | Displays filtered projects      |
| ProjectCard    | project                   | Displays single project details |

---

## ⚙️ Installation & Setup

### 1. Clone the Repository

```id="b1t9q2"
git clone https://github.com/your-username/portfolio-app.git
cd portfolio-app
```

---

### 2. Install Dependencies

```id="d7m4k6"
npm install
```

---

### 3. Run the Application

If using Vite:

```id="s9w3e1"
npm run dev
```

Then open:

```id="f6n2r8"
http://localhost:5173
```

